{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（22日）中午12時34分，一名男子行經通菜街時，突然遭3名男子衝前圍截。男子受驚逃跑，至通菜街103號一間點心店對開時不慎跌倒，隨即被該3名男子拳打腳踢。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，25歲姓盧男事主膝蓋及手背擦傷，由救護車送往廣華醫院治理。警方將案件列作「襲擊致造成身體傷害」，正追緝3名涉案男子歸案。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者被送到廣華醫院治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177191944246398976358470.jpeg/Fj8iD4Clc9goaur5T2503U_vXrb4xUXH50K41udCuNY\"/><figcaption>傷者被送到廣華醫院治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者被送到廣華醫院治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260219/1101159867034374144489207.jpeg/fHT6HfdLyQDwBGSZE6Ljrdoh4V5dDLw6e2KUbHtilGw\"/><figcaption>傷者被送到廣華醫院治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T07:22:12.369020+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:07:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T00:46:54.773019+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T07:17:39.381947+00:00","content_hash":"e21430b0119bf9815f7ae23e8bc60e3ecf30f48e12fe88964a42474e4ffa227b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}